# Terminal Portfolio

Static Next.js terminal portfolio for Shivang Gupta (DevOps/SRE). Client-only, no backend.

**Read first(if required):** `AGENTS.md` (architecture, commands, deployment, conventions).

**Content:** single source in `src/lib/constants.ts` — do not duplicate profile text elsewhere.

**Terminal:** `src/components/terminal/Terminal.tsx` + `CommandParser.ts`. Rich React outputs for `about`, `contact`, `projects` (clickable links) — preserve when editing.

**Deploy:** Cloudflare Pages active; GitHub Pages workflow disabled.

**Planned:** just-bash hybrid shell — see `docs/prd/just-bash-integration.md` (PRD only, not implemented).

**Mobile:** test 375px; use `break-words`, `inline: "nearest"` on scrollIntoView, no broken CSS resets on `*`.
